MyBrain
Copyright 2026 vicevinnybeats

MyBrain is derived from Graphify (https://github.com/Graphify-Labs/graphify),
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The original Graphify NOTICE
is reproduced above, and LICENSE / LICENSE-MIT are kept unchanged.

Changes made by MyBrain:
  - Renamed the package, CLI, slash command, output folder and all
    user-facing text from "graphify" to "mybrain" (MyBrain).
  - Removed the hosted-platform / sign-up / free-trial messages and links.
  - Generated HTML pages bundle their JavaScript (vis-network, d3, mermaid)
    instead of loading it from outside CDNs.
  - Replaced the Claude Code skill with a free, code-only-by-default skill
    (docs/PDF/images only through a local Ollama, never a paid API key).
  - Added the MyBrain web app (webapp/), the GitHub Actions workflow that
    publishes maps automatically, and the scripts in sync/ that re-apply
    these changes to newer Graphify versions.

Bundled third-party JavaScript (see sync/vendor/licenses/):
  - vis-network 9.1.6 (Apache-2.0 OR MIT)
  - d3 7.9.0 (ISC)
  - mermaid 11.12.0 (MIT)
